*.bak
# Dated backup copies: `foo.md.bak-cf-20260929`. Not matched by `*.bak`.
# The `*` after `bak-` is deliberate: a bare `*.bak*` would also swallow
# book content files whose slugs contain "bahan bakar" / "bakteri".
*.bak-*
*.zip

